<section class="decisions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Where it starts</div>
    <h2>Three requests that put revenue on the table</h2>
    <div class="dec-grid">
      <div class="dec">
        <span class="tag">Contract renewal</span>
        <h3>&ldquo;Complete this supplier questionnaire before we renew.&rdquo;</h3>
        <p>A buyer questionnaire is no longer administrative &mdash; it is a filter. Weak answers reprice or replace suppliers before price is even discussed.</p>
        <a href="{{@site.url}}/contract-clause-risk-review-eu-facing-suppliers/">Contract Clause Risk Review &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="dec">
        <span class="tag">CBAM data request</span>
        <h3>&ldquo;Your EU importer needs embedded-emissions data by Q3.&rdquo;</h3>
        <p>Under the definitive CBAM regime, carbon data became a cash-flow variable. The importer holds the legal duty &mdash; the supplier holds the data risk.</p>
        <a href="{{@site.url}}/cbam-evidence-review-brazilian-suppliers/">CBAM Evidence Review &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="dec">
        <span class="tag">EUDR traceability</span>
        <h3>&ldquo;Prove origin and geolocation for every shipment.&rdquo;</h3>
        <p>Application starts 30 December 2026 for large and medium operators. Buyers are requesting evidence files ahead of the law.</p>
        <a href="{{@site.url}}/eudr-evidence-readiness-review/">EUDR Evidence Readiness Review &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
